      "_comment": "EXPR-4: Three-level CPI-escalated collar PPA with negative-price protection. This is a real-world onshore wind PPA: (1) Base price 72 EUR/MWh is escalated annually by CPI ratio; (2) The escalated price is collared between floor 38 and cap 110; (3) If the day-ahead price goes negative, the entire payment drops to zero (neg-price gate). Formula: if(EPEX < 0) then 0 else clamp(38, 110, 72 * (HICP_current / HICP_base)).",
